{parent=Biology bibliography}
{c}

https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-HealthProfessional/

Office of Dietary Supplements, National Institutes of Health. Cited sections: Introduction, Vitamin C Deficiency and Food Sources. Used for the present-day explanation of dietary requirement, collagen synthesis and scurvy.

