https://www.who.int/en/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/dracunculiasis-%28guinea-worm-disease%29

Fact sheet, 30 January 2025, transmission and life cycle: infected copepods swallowed in water. This explanatory life cycle is not attributed to the 1865 candidate.

