{parent=Biology bibliography}
{c}
{title2=1887}

https://www.gutenberg.org/files/2010/2010-h/2010-h.htm

Posthumously published autobiographical account, written in 1876. The cited recollection of reading Malthus dates that reading to October 1838. Retrospective evidence need not settle the precise chronology of theory formation by itself.

