By <Hiroyuki Noji>, <Ryohei Yasuda>, <Masasuke Yoshida>, and <Kazuhiko Kinosita Jr.>. Nature 386, 299–302; published 20 March 1997. DOI 10.1038/386299a0.

https://www.nature.com/articles/386299a0

Cited passages: publisher abstract and author information. The abstract describes fluorescent-filament observation of isolated F1 rotation; it does not establish the complete membrane-coupled synthesis assay.

